// W4d surface fold-in — the levitation stage-0 declined-declaration golden.
//
// GRADUATION: this block parses, but its levitation-stage-0 elaboration in
// `gandr-surface-engine::desc_elab` declines it. The per-variable variance /
// linearity of a 2-cell face is derived from the faces, never declared
// (proposal-levitation-addendum-vdc.md §A/§C), so an attribute slot naming the
// reserved `variance` metadata is rejected with a host well-formedness
// diagnostic. `tests/desc_elab.rs` witnesses the decline.

// A datatype whose constructor tries to declare the reserved, derived
// `variance` metadata through an attribute slot.
data Declared { Mk [variance] }
